[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3420.87, "timestamp": "00:57:00", "text": "いいえ。ああ、泥棒のことですね。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3422.63, "timestamp": "00:57:02", "text": "やる価値があるなら、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3423.99, "timestamp": "00:57:03", "text": "（音楽の）代償を受け入れろ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3430.47, "timestamp": "00:57:10", "text": "アクセスクレードルなどのアップグレードは済ませましたか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3432.95, "timestamp": "00:57:12", "text": "完璧なデザイン。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3436.95, "timestamp": "00:57:16", "text": "ええ、そうですね。 うん。 でも、私はまだレベル4なんです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3438.47, "timestamp": "00:57:18", "text": "つまり、私はつい最近プレイし始めたばかりなんです"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3441.349, "timestamp": "00:57:21", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3445.99, "timestamp": "00:57:25", "text": "製品の仕上げにストランドを使用してください。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3449.03, "timestamp": "00:57:29", "text": "ええ、あのバックパックとかは、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3452.95, "timestamp": "00:57:32", "text": "派閥のアップグレードで開ける必要があるんです"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3455.67, "timestamp": "00:57:35", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3459.19, "timestamp": "00:57:39", "text": "ええ、クラフト可能なものを見つけて、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3461.91, "timestamp": "00:57:41", "text": "それから、派閥を"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3465.109, "timestamp": "00:57:45", "text": "アップグレードするためのアップグレードを開くためのサルベージリソースをすべて見つける必要があります"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3466.23, "timestamp": "00:57:46", "text": "。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3470.557, "timestamp": "00:57:50", "author": "@Ghewar_Ji_ka_No-1FAN", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/CqrtcQvHFvr33XJk7uI96qZ5HyIAEb1ifU1jdPzM7vetPMlUZ4oYhF9BjVOj5xYYbkMi18Zfvg=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/E8MfY5u7JPSXkNAP95GAmAEUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/E8MfY5u7JPSXkNAP95GAmAEUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/E8MfY5u7JPSXkNAP95GAmAE"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3478.23, "timestamp": "00:57:58", "text": "うん、最初は確かに混乱する"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3479.91, "timestamp": "00:57:59", "text": "けど、コツをつかめば"}]